  "details": "Exactly as the title states, I'd like to see the option to create a list of the packages I add to the Creator Companion that are already marked for import upon the creation of a new project. I make a new project for every avatar I make to prevent oversaturation and corruption, so needing to six poiyomi, liltoon, VRCFT, lightbox viewer, gogo loco, and at least six other packages minimum every single time gets really tedious. I've heard a few other people complain about that as well, so I can see this getting quite helpful.",
